  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-5\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 5</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <p class=\"intro-text\">La tenue des agents affectés à la surveillance du transport de personnes ne porte aucun signe distinctif d'une fonction. Ainsi, les boutons d'uniforme sont argentés, les épaulettes n'affichent aucun signe distinctif de la fonction.</p>\n            <p>Les articles 4.</p>\n            <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\">deuxième alinéa,</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\"></span>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\">\n                            <span class=\"sub-provision-text\"></span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ol>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\">\n                    <span class=\"provision-text\">ne sont pas applicables aux agents précités.</span>\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
